M1 net3 FCLK_2 net2 net2 PMOS_CI2N L={Lp} W={Wp}
M2 net2 net1 COMP COMP PMOS_CI2N L={Lp} W={Wp}
M3 net2 FCLK_4 VDD VDD PMOS_CI2N L={Lp} W={Wp}
